ls\">113 S.Ct. 397</a></span></extracted-citation>, <extracted-citation case-ids=\"11924825\" index=\"3\" url=\"https://cite.case.law/us/506/1/\"><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9432691\"><a href=\"/opinion/112790/martin-v-district-of-columbia-court-of-appeals/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Martin v. District of Columbia Court of Appeals\">121 L.Ed.2d 305</a></span></extracted-citation> (1992) ( <em>per curiam</em> ).</p></opinion>"}],"citations":[]}